# Summary

The handbook states that vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook [[cite:obs-09a0aaa42db48a0a118cb39ab95ab37e8789ed9f "Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook."]]. Bays twelve through thirty are reserved for supplier vans only and are blocked [[cite:obs-5021b279564bf4527f3958954599d92b1cab7ce3 "Bays twelve through thirty: blocked, supplier vans only"]]. There is a midday deadline for parking in these bays [[cite:obs-5021b279564bf4527f3958954599d92b1cab7ce3 "Bays twelve through thirty: blocked, supplier vans only, midday deadline."]].